OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry this
OL,6,Fevening and overnight with variable
OL,7,Famounts of cloud with some clear
OL,8,Fspells. Thicker cloud arrives across
OL,9,Fthe north of the region towards dawn
OL,10,Fwith outbreaks of light rain.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FOvercast with outbreaks of
OL,13,Frain, this locally heavy and
OL,14,Fpersistent across the hills and
OL,15,Fmountains of north Wales. Becoming
OL,16,Fdrier and brighter from the west
OL,17,Fduring the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
