OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FLargely settled through Thursday and
OL,7,FFriday, with chilly nights and bright,
OL,8,Fsunny days. Temperatures will feel
OL,9,Fwarm in the sunshine. Increasing
OL,10,Fcloudy from Saturday, bringing the
OL,11,Frisk of some rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
